          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="1a74-59f3-85ab-ecb7">During your shooting phase, make a leadership test for this unit. On a fail, enemy units have Lethal Hits while targeting this unit until the start of your next turn. This unit&apos;s Occult weapons now have Devastating Wounds until the start of your next turn. Alternatively, you can select one friendly unit within 9&quot; to suffer the lethal hits effect.</characteristic>
