    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Tornado of Souls" hidden="false" id="cc2c-7eaa-c049-55e6" sortIndex="4">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Tornado of Souls" typeId="0b00-c588-d8e3-fd9b" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="17a0-04f5-581c-2413">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="735b-d1ce-b6ea-55e6">18&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="b9f5-d618-08d7-cb66">d6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="HS" typeId="014c-9ce7-ab96-6dc3">N/A</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="0890-57f6-b39c-3afb">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="8faf-68ec-79c1-1e74">-1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="D" typeId="ba91-9e15-d0be-2790">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="05f3-68bd-4eee-3fa7">Torrent, Occult</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Tornado of Souls (Occult)" typeId="7c1a-6666-91ad-1439" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="ea3d-f5e5-0318-cdc2">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="1a74-59f3-85ab-ecb7">When Tornado of Souls is cast on an enemy unit, that enemy unit is then considered Inside the Tornado until the end of your next shooting phase. If Tornado of Souls is cast on an enemy unit already Inside the Tornado, then replace Inside the Tornado with Shredded by the Tornado. A unit with the tag Shredded by the Tornado, cannot have the tag Inside the Tornado. In your next shooting phase, if any enemy units have the tag Shredded by the Tornado, they are attacked by the Tornado of Souls spell once more without the spell being cast by an OCCULT unit. After the free cast has completed itself, remove the Shredded by the Tornado tag.

For Example: Timmy&apos;s occultist cast Tornado of Souls on a squad of Immolators. A d6 of attacks are rolled and so fourth. They now have the tag Inside the Tornado. On his next shooting phase, Timmy then hits that same unit with Tornado of Souls again. A d6 of attacks are rolled and so fourth. They now have the tag Shredded by the Tornado. On Timmy&apos;s next shooting phase, that immolator squad is instantly hit with a d6 of attacks from the Tornado of Souls spell. The attacks are rolled and so fourth. They are no longer considered Shredded by the Storm.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Torrent" id="6fd5-2057-a434-aea9" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="73cf-a385-c74c-5de0"/>
        <infoLink name="Occult" id="d254-c460-7492-fc76" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="424e-447a-a84c-7c36"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="0d54-ba68-a12e-4d2a" value="10"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Death &amp; Decay" hidden="false" id="7684-c1c2-f763-30e1" sortIndex="4">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Death &amp; Decay" typeId="0b00-c588-d8e3-fd9b" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="9a38-e74e-5472-637c">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="735b-d1ce-b6ea-55e6">18&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="b9f5-d618-08d7-cb66">d6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="HS" typeId="014c-9ce7-ab96-6dc3">N/A</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="0890-57f6-b39c-3afb">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="8faf-68ec-79c1-1e74">-2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="D" typeId="ba91-9e15-d0be-2790">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="05f3-68bd-4eee-3fa7">Torrent, Occult</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Death &amp; Decay (Occult)" typeId="7c1a-6666-91ad-1439" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0dbc-1eba-cb34-705e">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="1a74-59f3-85ab-ecb7">When casting Death &amp; Decay, instead of selecting an enemy unit, select a point within the spell&apos;s range. All enemy and friendly units within 3&quot; of that point are each hit by the spell.

For Example: Timmy sees a reliquant squad and a Sanctifier both have models within 3&quot; of the point he selected for Death &amp; Decay. First, Timmy chose to do an attack against the reliquant squad. He rolls a d6 for the attacks and the attacks go through their process. After those attacks are done, Timmy then turns to the Sanctifier and rolls a new d6 of attacks and goes through their process against the sanctifier</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Torrent" id="dacf-d0d8-0b39-f761" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="73cf-a385-c74c-5de0"/>
        <infoLink name="Occult" id="949f-67ee-8d75-07c2" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="424e-447a-a84c-7c36"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="0d54-ba68-a12e-4d2a" value="15"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Your Body Betrays You" hidden="false" id="4a0c-8061-b1a9-d594" sortIndex="5">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Your Body Betrays You" typeId="0b00-c588-d8e3-fd9b" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="00a3-61ee-7463-017c">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="735b-d1ce-b6ea-55e6">18&quot;</characteristic>
