  <rules>
    <rule name="Occult" id="424e-447a-a84c-7c36" hidden="false">
      <description>Lasting effects from Occult spells cannot stack</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Extra Attacks" id="9edc-b9f7-5440-7981" hidden="false">
      <description>Each time a unit containing one or more models with an EXTRA ATTACKS weapon fights, those models will make attacks with those weapons in addition to any others. In the Select Weapons step , for each of those models, you must select:
All of that model’s EXTRA ATTACKS weapons.
One of that model’s other melee weapons, if possible.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
